# OPEN. A held callable called with named actuals. Its header declares the
# formals x and y; h2(y: 2; x: 1) gives x 1 and y 2: 100 + 10 + 2. The binding
# does not reach a held callable's call yet, and it is refused as "unknown
# method". Entry 7.
fn: make2 (int: n) fn: (int: x; int: y) int
    fn: f2 (int: x; int: y) int
        return: n + x * 10 + y
    return: f2

h2: make2 100
int: got h2(y: 2; x: 1)
int: ok 7
if: got != 112
    ok: 81
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: ok; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
